  "content": "\n\n<h2>Zegarn PvP 資源包</h2>\n<p>一款專注於<strong>清晰、舒適與簡潔視覺效果</strong>的極簡 PvP 資源包。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpvp-zegarn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Modrinth 獲取更快更新</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforms.gle%252f7Km7EkeKcx7sAbDv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報問題或提供建議</a></span></p>\n<h2>✦ 更新紀錄</h2>\n<p><strong>1.3.4</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>全新圖示</li>\n<li>全新全景背景 <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c5ac2780a357a5679a1033cf11852c0f5426512_0.webp\" alt=\"全景背景\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1.3.3</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>全新快捷欄高亮</li>\n<li>全新提示框背景</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 功能特色</h2>\n<p><strong>視覺效果</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>簡潔極簡的 HUD</li>\n<li>深色介面主題</li>\n<li>自定義準星</li>\n<li>自定義天空</li>\n<li>自定義主選單與全景畫面</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>材質</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>重做盔甲、物品與方塊</li>\n<li>重生图腾重製</li>\n<li>末影水晶更新</li>\n<li>盾牌材質重製</li>\n<li>細雪更新</li>\n<li>小型火焰</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>玩法優化</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>作物生長指示器</li>\n<li>生命值與飽食度重新配色</li>\n<li>紅石微調</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>音效</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>自定義音效（已更新並精修）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>介面 / GUI</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>物品欄重新設計</li>\n<li>提示框與高亮效果優化</li>\n<li>更簡潔的介面元素</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 需求</h2>\n<p><strong>天空（Forge）：</strong> <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>天空（Fabric）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDWuwk8aA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a></span></li>\n<li>或</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fYBz7DOs8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit</a></span> 與 <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fHpdHOPOp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit Interop</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 俄語版本</h2>\n<h2>✦ 功能特色</h2>\n<p><strong>視覺效果</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>簡潔極簡的 HUD</li>\n<li>深色介面主題</li>\n<li>自定義準星</li>\n<li>自定義天空</li>\n<li>自定義主選單與全景畫面</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>材質</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>重做盔甲、物品與方塊</li>\n<li>重生图腾重製</li>\n<li>末影水晶更新</li>\n<li>盾牌材質重製</li>\n<li>細雪更新</li>\n<li>小型火焰</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>玩法優化</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>作物生長指示器</li>\n<li>生命值與飽食度重新配色</li>\n<li>紅石微調</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>音效</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>自定義音效（已更新並精修）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>介面 / GUI</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>物品欄重新設計</li>\n<li>提示框與高亮效果優化</li>\n<li>更簡潔的介面元素</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 需求</h2>\n<p><strong>天空（Forge）：</strong> <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>天空（Fabric）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDWuwk8aA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a></span></li>\n<li>或</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fYBz7DOs8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit</a></span> 與 <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fHpdHOPOp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit Interop</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>✦ 致謝</h2>\n<p>部分方塊材質參考自： <span style=\"color:#4500ad\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones</a></span></p>",
